OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA mostly
OL,6,Fcloudy evening with showers and a few
OL,7,Fclear intervals possible. Remaining
OL,8,Fmostly cloudy with occasional showers
OL,9,Fovernight but some clear intervals.
OL,10,FWinds will be a moderate to fresh
OL,11,Fnortherly.
OL,12,
OL,13,CFriday:FA mostly cloudy day with
OL,14,Fshowers spreading southwards, wintry
OL,15,Fon hills, perhaps lower levels over
OL,16,FShetland later. A few bright or sunny
OL,17,Fintervals between showers. Fresh
OL,18,Fnortherly winds. Feeling cold.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
