OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FA
OL,6,Ffairly bright weekend with some
OL,7,Fsunshine at times but still a few
OL,8,Fshowers around. Mostly dry with
OL,9,Fsunshine and a few showers on Monday.
